<title>USA: Beazer Homes USA sees March results hurt.</title>
<headline>Beazer Homes USA sees March results hurt.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beazer Homes USA Inc said on Thursday that a lower backlog and higher expenses will hurt its results in the quarter ending March 31.</p>
<p>But with new subdivisions about to open, the company is optimistic about a stronger performance in the spring and summer.</p>
<p>Also Thursday, Beazer said Moody's Investor Service has placed the company's debt under review for a possible upgrade.</p>
</text>
